    "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/voice/drx-p1-v1/p1/05.wav",
    "tts_text": "でっかい動物の頭の骨やんか！",
    "at": 271,
    "mood": "tense_shake"
   },
   {
    "text": "将来有望な悪ガキやわ！",
    "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/voice/drx-p1-v1/p1/06.wav",
    "tts_text": "将来有望な悪ガキやわ！",
    "at": 335,
    "mood": "up_pop"
   },
   {
    "text": "今度は、牛の群れがやってきた！",
